    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71711604\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p>The road to the village floods for four months every year. While a pregnant woman is put into an ambulance, the hospital has no surgeon on duty. In a semi-permanent ward, a health worker follows a protocol designed for a tertiary hospital that bears little resemblance to the conditions in which they work.</p><p>These are not hypothetical scenarios.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 17, 2026 05:19 pm IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71711604\" data-title=\"Why frontline experience and operational research need to come together in the health sector\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/op-ed/why-frontline-experience-and-operational-research-need-to-come-together-in-the-health-sector/article71711604.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-d42472aaf6e74899242a70b8-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/op-ed/why-frontline-experience-and-operational-research-need-to-come-together-in-the-health-sector/article71711604.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Why%20frontline%20experience%20and%20operational%20research%20need%20to%20come%20together%20in%20the%20health%20sector&amp;amp;body=Check%20out%20this%20link%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fopinion%2Fop-ed%2Fwhy-frontline-experience-and-operational-research-need-to-come-together-in-the-health-s